{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/846838-other-denizens-in-the-lair","id":846838,"title":"Other denizens in the Lair?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-03-13T18:08:47-07:00","id":846838,"title":"Other denizens in the Lair?","content":"is it possible for other things to live in the Lair besides the Horror? finally got one of my players to take over GM for a minute, and he ended up taking was was originally intended to be a Changeling and make something more Beast like... which is fine, but he has these &quot;Spider-Dogs&quot; inside of the Lair, and I'm just wondering if these things could be backed up by fluff at all? It doesn't matter, and I'm 99% sure he hasn't read BtP, I'm just curious.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-14T08:55:46-07:00","id":847103,"title":"","content":"The Lair can come with premade inhabitants if that suits its makeup - those wouldn't be truly living beings, though they'd look it to the casual visitor - ETA, I can't recall if Beast itself specifies that, but it was stated by one of